// A marker is a marker only on a line of its own. An `on` written after code
// is an ordinary comment and does not close the region, exactly as an `off`
// written there does not open one -- otherwise the two ends of the hatch read
// by different rules.
// linea fmt: off
fn kept()   -> UInt8 { 0 } // linea fmt: on
fn also()   -> UInt8 { 1 }
